1
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:18,270
♪I stretch and yawn
when the sun is high in the sky♪

2
00:00:19,170 --> 00:00:23,030
♪A cup of tea and a little tune,
what a carefree life♪

3
00:00:23,890 --> 00:00:28,480
♪The fortune teller said
love would come my way this year♪

4
00:00:28,740 --> 00:00:32,580
♪But all I see is my food
arriving right on time♪

5
00:00:33,850 --> 00:00:35,670
♪No rush, no worries♪

6
00:00:35,670 --> 00:00:38,360
♪Love is all a matter of chance♪

7
00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:40,480
♪Flowers bloom and fade♪

8
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:43,380
♪I'd rather take good care
of myself first♪

9
00:00:43,380 --> 00:00:45,580
♪Two orioles sing among
the green willows♪

10
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:47,970
♪And I still don't have a boyfriend♪

11
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:50,590
♪My best years are nothing
to worry about♪

12
00:00:50,590 --> 00:00:53,240
♪I'll stay happily single
till I'm old and gray♪

13
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:07,540
=Besties' Coming Fortune=

14
00:01:07,580 --> 00:01:09,980
=Episode 24=

15
00:01:10,860 --> 00:01:12,940
(Heroines Who Fell
at the Battle of Qiyun Pass)

16
00:01:20,040 --> 00:01:21,560
I, Shen Cheng,
second son of Marquis Jingyuan,

17
00:01:22,400 --> 00:01:24,310
thank you all for risking your lives
to preserve the truth.

18
00:01:24,540 --> 00:01:25,380
(Heroines Who Fell
at the Battle of Qiyun Pass)

19
00:01:25,380 --> 00:01:26,840
My parents' names
have finally been cleared.

20
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:28,030
You deserve the greatest credit.

21
00:01:29,480 --> 00:01:31,920
I, Shen Cheng, hereby swear
that your names shall forever be honored

22
00:01:32,560 --> 00:01:33,670
in the Marquis's ancestral hall.

23
00:01:34,150 --> 00:01:36,760
Throughout the year,
incense offerings shall never cease.

24
00:01:37,640 --> 00:01:39,360
I, Shen He,
third son of Marquis Jingyuan,

25
00:01:39,900 --> 00:01:40,720
offer you my deepest gratitude.

26
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:42,950
After years of wrongful accusations,

27
00:01:43,640 --> 00:01:45,510
it was thanks to you and your testimony,
given at the cost of your lives,

28
00:01:45,510 --> 00:01:47,680
(Heroines Who Fell
at the Battle of Qiyun Pass)

29
00:01:47,680 --> 00:01:48,510
that we have finally

30
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:51,640
secured justice for you as well.

31
00:02:26,860 --> 00:02:34,540
(Shen Manor)

32
00:02:42,630 --> 00:02:43,360
Dear sisters,

33
00:02:43,960 --> 00:02:44,920
we can never repay

34
00:02:45,470 --> 00:02:47,110
the kindness the Marquis's family
has shown us.

35
00:02:47,910 --> 00:02:49,640
Now that my sister has fully recovered,

36
00:02:50,100 --> 00:02:51,530
it's time for us to return home.

37
00:02:52,960 --> 00:02:54,310
We've always called you Xiaozhi,

38
00:02:54,310 --> 00:02:55,790
but what's your full name?

39
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:57,510
My name is Song Zhi'ang.

40
00:02:57,880 --> 00:02:58,830
Zhi as in tree branch,

41
00:02:59,210 --> 00:03:00,210
and Ang as in holding one's head high.

42
00:03:02,240 --> 00:03:02,670
Song...

43
00:03:03,120 --> 00:03:03,600
Zhi...

44
00:03:04,030 --> 00:03:04,440
Ang...

45
00:03:04,950 --> 00:03:06,010
- Zhang...
- Zhang...

46
00:03:08,870 --> 00:03:09,950
She's the original heroine.

47
00:03:14,800 --> 00:03:15,710
Xiaozhi.

48
00:03:17,150 --> 00:03:18,230
Before you leave,

49
00:03:19,950 --> 00:03:21,080
let me tell you a story.

50
00:03:22,720 --> 00:03:23,950
It begins

51
00:03:24,680 --> 00:03:26,110
with you and your sister
traveling to the capital.

52
00:03:26,840 --> 00:03:28,080
Something terrible happens
along the way.

53
00:03:29,240 --> 00:03:31,510
Your sister is killed
by the Third Prince's men.

54
00:03:32,430 --> 00:03:33,790
You arrive in the capital alone,

55
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:35,240
without a penny to your name

56
00:03:35,240 --> 00:03:36,160
and nowhere to turn.

57
00:03:37,310 --> 00:03:38,880
Then you meet a man.

58
00:03:39,680 --> 00:03:41,270
He helps you uncover the real culprit.

59
00:03:42,080 --> 00:03:43,160
Together,

60
00:03:43,870 --> 00:03:44,590
step by step,

61
00:03:44,590 --> 00:03:45,590
you expose

62
00:03:45,590 --> 00:03:46,550
all the Third Prince's schemes.

63
00:03:48,310 --> 00:03:49,760
You avenge your sister

64
00:03:50,560 --> 00:03:52,360
and bring justice

65
00:03:53,360 --> 00:03:54,360
to everyone who died unjustly.

66
00:03:55,470 --> 00:03:56,600
And after that...

67
00:04:01,120 --> 00:04:01,990
After that,

68
00:04:04,280 --> 00:04:06,200
you marry him

69
00:04:06,750 --> 00:04:09,320
and become the wife
of the Marquis's Heir.

70
00:04:09,630 --> 00:04:10,400
You manage the household

71
00:04:10,400 --> 00:04:11,680
and earn the admiration of thousands.

72
00:04:11,680 --> 00:04:12,320
Wait...

73
00:04:14,960 --> 00:04:15,920
The Heir?

74
00:04:16,950 --> 00:04:17,910
Shen Cheng?

75
00:04:18,190 --> 00:04:19,320
That cold and terrifying man?

76
00:04:19,750 --> 00:04:20,510
Me, with him?

77
00:04:24,190 --> 00:04:26,590
How desperate would I have to be

78
00:04:26,830 --> 00:04:28,640
to fall for a man like that?

79
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:36,270
Wait, did you just say

80
00:04:36,870 --> 00:04:37,560
that in this story,

81
00:04:38,390 --> 00:04:39,150
my sister

82
00:04:40,160 --> 00:04:40,950
dies?

83
00:04:45,510 --> 00:04:46,640
If meeting this man

84
00:04:47,070 --> 00:04:48,270
and finding this supposedly
wonderful marriage

85
00:04:48,750 --> 00:04:50,030
means sacrificing my sister's life,

86
00:04:51,120 --> 00:04:51,830
then I don't want

87
00:04:53,040 --> 00:04:53,590
any part of it.

88
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:56,880
As long as I, Song Zhi'ang, live,

89
00:04:58,060 --> 00:04:58,800
having my sister by my side

90
00:04:59,430 --> 00:05:00,320
matters more than anything.

91
00:05:01,680 --> 00:05:02,360
Who cares

92
00:05:02,360 --> 00:05:03,240
about being the Heir's wife

93
00:05:03,750 --> 00:05:04,590
or living in the Marquis's Manor?

94
00:05:09,480 --> 00:05:10,320
I have my sister.

95
00:05:12,190 --> 00:05:12,680
That's enough.

96
00:05:22,660 --> 00:05:26,820
(Shen Manor)

97
00:05:34,480 --> 00:05:35,150
Well, look who's here.

98
00:05:35,480 --> 00:05:37,640
The Third Prince certainly knows
how to enjoy himself.

99
00:05:37,830 --> 00:05:39,350
Even in prison, you seem so relaxed

100
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:40,910
and untroubled.

101
00:05:41,240 --> 00:05:42,240
Come to laugh at me?

102
00:05:46,630 --> 00:05:48,390
Do you really think you've won?

103
00:05:50,270 --> 00:05:51,830
I simply let my guard down.

104
00:05:54,600 --> 00:05:55,760
(Prisoner)
The winner takes all.

105
00:05:56,240 --> 00:05:57,150
That's all there is to it.

106
00:05:57,430 --> 00:05:58,350
If I could do it all over again,

107
00:05:58,510 --> 00:05:59,910
I'd still kill your parents.

108
00:06:00,070 --> 00:06:00,720
I'd still sacrifice

109
00:06:00,720 --> 00:06:01,190
those women's lives

110
00:06:01,190 --> 00:06:02,240
to claim military glory.

111
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:03,880
What I want

112
00:06:04,800 --> 00:06:06,310
is power over the entire realm.

113
00:06:06,310 --> 00:06:07,040
Anyone who stands in my way,

114
00:06:07,040 --> 00:06:07,950
I'll have them killed!

115
00:06:08,510 --> 00:06:09,910
That's the path I've chosen!

116
00:06:19,270 --> 00:06:20,360
By the Mandate of Heaven,

117
00:06:20,360 --> 00:06:21,470
His Majesty decrees.

118
00:06:22,510 --> 00:06:24,310
The Third Prince
murdered fellow officers,

119
00:06:24,310 --> 00:06:25,270
poisoned innocent people,

120
00:06:25,270 --> 00:06:26,200
and deceived the Emperor.

121
00:06:26,800 --> 00:06:27,830
For these numerous crimes,

122
00:06:28,310 --> 00:06:29,320
he cannot be pardoned.

123
00:06:30,300 --> 00:06:30,860
(Imperial Decree)

124
00:06:32,240 --> 00:06:33,320
In consideration of his royal blood,

125
00:06:33,870 --> 00:06:35,120
he shall be given a cup of poisoned wine

126
00:06:36,560 --> 00:06:37,800
so his body remains intact.

127
00:06:42,510 --> 00:06:43,200
What's this?

128
00:06:44,270 --> 00:06:45,080
What is this stuff?

129
00:06:45,950 --> 00:06:46,640
Third Prince.

130
00:06:47,390 --> 00:06:47,880
You should

131
00:06:48,480 --> 00:06:49,830
recognize this poison.

132
00:06:50,600 --> 00:06:52,240
It's the same poison

133
00:06:52,580 --> 00:06:53,640
you forced those women
to drink back then.

134
00:06:55,040 --> 00:06:55,710
That can't be.

135
00:06:56,310 --> 00:06:57,030
That can't be!

136
00:06:58,040 --> 00:06:58,880
I'm his son!

137
00:07:00,070 --> 00:07:01,350
I'm his own son!

138
00:07:07,950 --> 00:07:08,560
Don't leave!

139
00:07:09,190 --> 00:07:10,830
I'm his own son! I...

140
00:07:11,510 --> 00:07:12,000
What are you doing?

141
00:07:12,310 --> 00:07:13,000
Get away!

142
00:07:13,480 --> 00:07:13,910
Get away!

143
00:07:14,070 --> 00:07:14,390
Go away!

144
00:07:14,560 --> 00:07:14,880
Go away!

145
00:07:35,680 --> 00:07:36,270
Let's go.

146
00:07:41,950 --> 00:07:42,830
Let's go home.

147
00:07:46,490 --> 00:07:47,800
♪Flowers in bloom♪

148
00:07:47,800 --> 00:07:51,230
♪Gently scatter across the sky♪

149
00:07:53,640 --> 00:07:54,910
♪A gentle breeze♪

150
00:07:54,910 --> 00:07:58,500
(Wedding)

151
00:07:58,920 --> 00:08:00,240
(Our parents' names
were finally cleared.)

152
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:03,150
(They were posthumously honored
as Duke Zhongyi and Lady Zhonglie.)

153
00:08:03,870 --> 00:08:05,200
(Cenotaphs for the six dancing girls)

154
00:08:05,870 --> 00:08:07,030
(were erected below Qiyun Pass.)

155
00:08:08,680 --> 00:08:10,240
(Song Zhirou was honored
for her bravery.)

156
00:08:10,510 --> 00:08:11,880
(Song Zhi'ang joined
the Imperial Medical Service.)

157
00:08:12,560 --> 00:08:14,150
(With the truth about Qiyun Pass
finally revealed,)

158
00:08:14,830 --> 00:08:15,440
(we)

159
00:08:15,560 --> 00:08:16,270
(also held)

160
00:08:16,270 --> 00:08:17,880
(the wedding we truly deserved.)

161
00:08:20,430 --> 00:08:21,320
(First bow to Heaven and Earth.)

162
00:08:21,330 --> 00:08:23,210
♪The distance between us♪

163
00:08:23,610 --> 00:08:26,870
♪Blurs my vision♪

164
00:08:28,720 --> 00:08:30,000
(Second bow to the elders.)

165
00:08:34,240 --> 00:08:35,470
(Bow to each other.)

166
00:08:40,720 --> 00:08:42,560
If you don't want me to live,

167
00:08:42,840 --> 00:08:43,830
then you won't live either!

168
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:47,520
Spit it out!

169
00:08:50,120 --> 00:08:52,950
♪Reflecting your face♪

170
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:56,840
♪No longer hiding
the slightest urge to embrace you♪

171
00:08:56,870 --> 00:08:57,350
(Don't move.)

172
00:08:57,670 --> 00:08:58,280
(Let me help you.)

173
00:08:59,960 --> 00:09:03,480
♪You are the most beautiful encounter♪

174
00:09:04,120 --> 00:09:07,020
♪In all my years
of wandering through lifetimes♪

175
00:09:07,290 --> 00:09:10,660
♪Hand in hand, we'll walk through♪

176
00:09:12,520 --> 00:09:17,040
♪Spring, summer, fall, and winter♪

177
00:09:21,080 --> 00:09:21,750
Now,

178
00:09:22,270 --> 00:09:22,870
your poisoning

179
00:09:22,870 --> 00:09:24,040
can be cured for good.

180
00:09:24,200 --> 00:09:25,800
So you risked your life doing all this

181
00:09:27,080 --> 00:09:28,110
just to leave me?

182
00:09:30,240 --> 00:09:31,230
(I'd rather have you hate me.)

183
00:09:32,870 --> 00:09:33,790
(I couldn't bear)

184
00:09:33,790 --> 00:09:35,040
(to let you die with me.)

185
00:09:35,720 --> 00:09:36,750
(Who do you think you are?)

186
00:09:36,750 --> 00:09:38,440
(What gives you the right
to decide for me?)

187
00:09:39,460 --> 00:09:40,180
(May I spend this life
by your side, never to part)

188
00:09:40,180 --> 00:09:40,900
(The divorce was only a cover,)
If I came back alive,

189
00:09:40,900 --> 00:09:41,570
(never what I truly wanted)
If I came back alive,

190
00:09:42,240 --> 00:09:42,870
this Marriage Certificate

191
00:09:44,270 --> 00:09:45,320
was what I wanted to give you.

192
00:09:46,320 --> 00:09:48,140
♪In this moment, we cross♪

193
00:09:48,740 --> 00:09:51,520
♪The red thread of fate♪

194
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:55,200
♪Our hands clasp tightly♪

195
00:09:55,470 --> 00:09:58,480
♪Holding on to our future♪

196
00:10:00,320 --> 00:10:02,420
♪The years of unspoken feelings♪

197
00:10:02,850 --> 00:10:04,320
♪Are quietly changing♪

198
00:10:04,360 --> 00:10:05,080
What are you doing?

199
00:10:05,080 --> 00:10:06,200
What are you going to do to me?

200
00:10:06,200 --> 00:10:07,560
Exactly what you did to me.

201
00:10:07,790 --> 00:10:08,870
Rectal administration.

202
00:10:09,000 --> 00:10:10,080
Twice the effectiveness.

203
00:10:12,320 --> 00:10:12,870
A coroner

204
00:10:13,120 --> 00:10:14,150
seeks justice for the living

205
00:10:14,150 --> 00:10:15,280
and speaks for the dead.

206
00:10:15,720 --> 00:10:17,320
It's an honest living based on skill.

207
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:18,830
You're really good at this.

208
00:10:19,440 --> 00:10:20,230
Could you teach me?

209
00:10:20,720 --> 00:10:22,350
You'll have to pay some tuition first.

210
00:10:23,360 --> 00:10:24,040
What are you doing?

211
00:10:24,320 --> 00:10:25,520
I'm a traditional man.

212
00:10:26,200 --> 00:10:26,800
Enough talking.

213
00:10:27,240 --> 00:10:27,710
Open your eyes.

214
00:10:34,080 --> 00:10:35,920
(I read your coroner's manual.)

215
00:10:36,240 --> 00:10:37,320
(Some of the examination techniques)

216
00:10:37,320 --> 00:10:38,630
(for male and female bodies
are incorrect.)

217
00:10:39,120 --> 00:10:40,320
(This way, it'll be easier)

218
00:10:40,320 --> 00:10:42,350
(to teach you the next time
you ask me for guidance.)

219
00:10:42,720 --> 00:10:44,990
(I, Lin Shutiao, don't belong to you.)

220
00:10:45,150 --> 00:10:46,840
(I don't want you deciding
how to protect me.)

221
00:10:46,840 --> 00:10:48,110
(I want you to respect me.)

222
00:10:51,550 --> 00:10:52,920
(Do you still think)

223
00:10:53,630 --> 00:10:55,320
(we're complete strangers?)

224
00:10:57,360 --> 00:10:58,230
(In your heart,)

225
00:10:58,550 --> 00:11:00,200
(do you only see me
as a younger brother?)

226
00:11:00,200 --> 00:11:01,440
(Then what place do you want?)

227
00:11:03,270 --> 00:11:03,800
(This)

228
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:07,470
(is where I want to be.)

229
00:11:08,200 --> 00:11:08,990
(What is)

230
00:11:09,240 --> 00:11:09,950
(this?)

231
00:11:10,630 --> 00:11:11,560
My answer.

232
00:11:12,520 --> 00:11:16,150
♪Spring, summer, fall, and winter♪

233
00:11:24,720 --> 00:11:25,830
To the bridal...

234
00:11:30,320 --> 00:11:31,110
- Again?
- Again?

235
00:11:31,860 --> 00:11:32,580
(That's a wrap)

236
00:11:32,600 --> 00:11:34,920
♪No matter how
the universe changes tomorrow♪

237
00:11:34,920 --> 00:11:42,120
♪Right now, I just want
to stay by your side♪

238
00:11:42,120 --> 00:11:47,320
♪Let this kiss and this dream
last until we're old♪

239
00:11:48,520 --> 00:11:53,560
♪And hold on to all
the tenderness of this moment♪

240
00:11:54,920 --> 00:12:00,000
♪Following this heartbeat,
we'll retrace our steps♪

241
00:12:01,360 --> 00:12:06,480
♪As time goes by,
all I need is your gaze♪

242
00:12:07,760 --> 00:12:11,120
♪One dream until our hair turns gray♪

243
00:12:29,880 --> 00:12:33,240
♪One dream until our hair turns gray♪
